<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We praise Thee for Thy heart’s intent</l><l>That man Thy likeness should possess,</l><l>That with Thy life and nature filled</l><l>Thine image he should manifest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Man in Thine image Thou didst make,</l><l>To him authority didst give;</l><l>Thyself presenting as his life,</l><l>That by Thy riches he might live.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>To enter man Thou dost desire,</l><l>With him to mingle thru Thy grace,</l><l>That man may be transformed and built</l><l>To be Thy worthy dwelling place.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Tho’ man did fall, Thou didst not leave</l><l>Thy heart’s intent, but Thou didst move;</l><l>Redeeming man to bring him back,</l><l>Thou didst Thy love and wisdom prove.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>In Christ Thou didst Thyself reveal,</l><l>Who died and rose, redemption wrought;</l><l>In Spirit Thou hast entered man</l><l>And to him life and grace hast brought.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>My spirit is Thy holiest place,</l><l>Thy throne of grace is founded there;</l><l>Thou wouldst that we in spirit come</l><l>To burn the incense thru our prayer.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Such grace is like a river full</l><l>Which from the throne of grace doth come;</l><l>It floweth thru, transforming us,</l><l>And builds us up to be Thy home.</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>Receiving of Thy matchless grace,</l><l>We marvel at Thy gift so free;</l><l>With grateful hearts for Thy great love,</l><l>In spirit now we worship Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
